  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Environment and Economy against Drought and Degradation in TEDA (K-SEED Project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1. Number of beneficiaries supported with landscape management related capacity building education/service, 1.2. Number of water supply facilities established, 2.1. Proportion of beneficiaries adopting Climate Smart Agriculture technologies, 2.2. Number of Saving Group members with improved access to finance, 3.1. Number of Climate change related plans established at country level, 3.2. Number of policy suggestions drafted by commynity led advocacy groups</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduced greenhouse gas emission and enhanced resilience of communities to climate change impacts through landscape restoration in Tsavo Ecosystem and Dispersal Area, Kenya1.1. &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C; &#xC8FC;&#xB3C4; &#xACBD;&#xAD00;&#xBCF5;&#xC6D0; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;&#xAC15;&#xD654;, 1.2. &#xC218;&#xC790;&#xC6D0; &#xC811;&#xADFC;&#xC131; &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1;, 2.1. &#xAE30;&#xD6C4; &#xC2A4;&#xB9C8;&#xD2B8; &#xB18D;&#xC5C5; &#xBC0F; &#xD63C;&#xB18D;&#xC784;&#xC5C5; &#xCCB4;&#xACC4; &#xAD6C;&#xCD95;, 2.2. &#xAE30;&#xD6C4;&#xC704;&#xAE30; &#xB300;&#xC751; &#xAE08;&#xC735; &#xC811;&#xADFC;&#xC131; &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1;, 3.1. &#xAE30;&#xD6C4;&#xBCC0;&#xD654; &#xB300;&#xC751; &#xC815;&#xCC45; &#xBC0F; &#xC9C0;&#xC2DD;&#xAD00;&#xB9AC; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;, 3.2. &#xC8FC;&#xBBFC;&#xC8FC;&#xB3C4; &#xAE30;&#xD6C4;&#xBCC0;&#xD654; &#xC639;&#xD638;&#xD65C;&#xB3D9; &#xCC38;&#xC5EC; &#xC99D;&#xC9C4;</narrative>
